flowchart TB
    L1["① Connection layer　it installs · it connects<br/>the first hurdle for non-technical users: fail here and the product doesn't exist"]
    L2["② Conversation layer　talk like a person · send things · receive things<br/>the one place you can't afford to fail: fail here and everything after is wasted"]
    L3["③ Capability layer　it actually gets things done<br/>decides whether it's useful"]
    L4["④ Device layer　it manages more than one machine<br/>where the difference lies"]
    L5["⑤ Trust layer　approval · memory · audit · privacy<br/>decides whether you dare use it long term"]
    L1 --> L2 --> L3 --> L4 --> L5
